    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A twelve-bar blues, swung (docs/plan/prompts/69)." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Every eighth on this page is written straight, because that is how a blues" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// is written and how a reader wants to read it. What makes it a shuffle is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the word `swing` in the profile — the notated duration is not the performed" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// duration (roadmap §2), and this is the first piece in the corpus where the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// two differ." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The proof is in the exports rather than in the sound: the MEI, LilyPond and" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// MusicXML of this piece contain even eighths, and the performance MIDI does" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// not. An engraver that drew triplets here would be printing an" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// interpretation nobody wrote down." },
